{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"大菩薩藏經校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"一．是書校歷二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"二．譯校凡用二種異本。（一）西藏法性戒譯大寶積經第十二會菩薩藏經.校註略","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"稱藏本。（二）宋法護等譯佛說大乘菩薩藏正法經．略稱宋本。兩種幷擧則稱二","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"三．譯校凡有二例。（一）二本文句歧異堪資尋討者．悉註出曰．某本雲雲。（二）二本","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"意義明暢可供參證者．悉註出曰．勘某本意雲雲。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"四．刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對勘北宋刻及麗刻訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．依某刻","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"五．校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"（一）西藏譯菩薩藏經．H!phags-pabyan%-chubsems-dpah!isde-snodc#es-byas-pa","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"theg-pachen-poh!imdo．奈旦版甘珠．寶積部Ga字函．一頁至四○八頁上。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"（二）宋譯佛說大乘菩薩藏正法經．日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"經本。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"（三）本書南北宋刻及麗刻．悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大正藏","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_72_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_72","text":"經本之校註。","sortOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}